    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c7925f7671a81b27cb57793"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Through [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreDeeJoral],J'oral]] I got in touch with [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBobKurita],Bob Yamaguchi]] and I convinced him to sponsor this expedition.\n\nAlthough it might too sensible material to publish now... once the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[Lore4thSuccessionWar],war]] is over, it might be possible to reveal it.",
