    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c420f05e1afc1b9ca8a6787"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "What are you talking about?\n\nWhen we met on [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMirfak],Mirfak]] you were working for [[DM.Factions[faction_MaglissSpirits],Magliss Spirits]], while discovering evidence of [[DM.Factions[faction_TaurianConcordat],Taurian]] atrocities, so what is going on here and who do you really work for?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
