      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c0dbc5ed9dd8284d5dd10b7"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "They have very long arms into the [[DM.Factions[faction_FederatedSuns],Federated Suns]]' government Commander and besides propaganda, they are working together with the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreNAIS],NAIS]] on the top secret weapons projects.\n\nAnd I am mostly independent, but with the current war, there is a lot of interest on [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHanseDavion],Hanse Davion]]'s secret projects.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
