    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cbc80014e4546da90f673a5"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "OK, so you mentioned strange electromagnetic signatures, what are you exactly looking for?\n\nAnd why do you believe that it is House Davion and IU are behind it?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
