          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c7b8813db01b2349e35881a"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Something important enough destroyed part of the New Syrtis shipyards years ago, although the official report from the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreDavionAFFS],AFFS]] mentions only a 'fuel leakage' and the total extent of the damage has been hidden.\n\nMeanwhile the same anomalous signature reported on New Syrtis was later reported in several other worlds close to the Davion-Periphery border.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "What are we talking about here Jarring?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cc645b8d48566d8949df514"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c6caf1678f39a4f8bb1652f"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "My bet is that it is a weapon of mass destruction based on [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreKearnyFuchida],Kearny-Fuchida]] principles, back in the Star League they call it a 'null bomb'.\n\nIt is a device that can disrupt [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHPG],hyper pulse generation]] and cripple interstellar travel and communications.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb65df39e2bd7ce3e152eef"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
