        "id": "9ca73377cd08cc642dff6672"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "And you have definitive evidence of this 'null bomb' other than circumstantial evidence?\n\nWeapons that can interfere with HPG communications and interstellar travel are theoretical, there was never any evidence that anyone has ever worked on them since the end of the Star League.",
