        "id": "9c8658ed8d71fcc72a38254a"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Dr. Murad, is there anything in the Project [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreProjectUMBRELLA],UMBRELLA]] files that can confirm this existence of this weapon since they were already working in top secret projects?",
      "branches": [
        {
