    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ccac9ed4ec8583088b5c671"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "No... I mean, there are theoretical references for using terraforming technology as planetary weapons, but not a 'null bomb'.\n\nI mean, I suspect it might be also possible according to Kearny-Fuchida principles, but to interfere with interstellar travel and communications would be equivalent to a weapon of mass destruction.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
