    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c8d2265ed9fa8855228cc01"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "After the initial report in New Syrtis on the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreCapellanMarch],Capellan March]] a couple of years ago, new reports came of spikes in K-F activity and corresponding radiation that was officially explained as 'never encountered natural phenomena'.\n\nThen a JumpShip crew first reported these 'spikes' after arriving at [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreEuschelus],Euschelus]] zenith point, and then reports came from [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreCadiz],Cadiz]], [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMicrosIII],Micros III]] and finally [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMirfak],Mirfak]], were we met.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
