    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c945b63f33e2bcd42ecf51d"
      },
      "index": 13,
      "text": "And the 'null bomb', what is the proof that the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreNAIS],NAIS]] and [[DM.Factions[faction_InterconnectednessUnlimited],IU]] are actually working on that matter?\n\nCount von Steffelbus might just be filming another propaganda [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHolovid],holovid]] down there and nearby stars going supernova usually a better explanation for such HPG disruptions.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 14,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
