      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c868a522f599cd1052a0ee8"
      },
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Or maybe the entire propaganda is about convincing Davion's enemies that something important is taking place in this backwater world such as a magic weapon that they should be fear.\n\nJarring, we could just be looking at a whole [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMIIO],MIIO]] deception operation.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
