        "id": "9ced111b06820758aa217b88"
      },
      "index": 16,
      "text": "The presence of both the Count von Steffelbus and Duke Richards on Liu's Memory, plus the rift between [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMichaelHasekDavion],Michael Hasek-Davion]] and [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHanseDavion],Hanse Davion]] imply something important is taking place on this world.",
      "branches": [
        {
